(5850880, 850602, 74911, '<td valign="top">I like the way you managed to hang the pepper and still not make it visible. For basic editing, this is a great job. I suppose the lighting on the pepper could have been brighter. Had you used a thread to tie the pepper, then more light would be difficult. I think the red line on the border could have been a lot thinner.</td>', 'I like the way you managed to hang the pepper and still not make it visible. For basic editing, this is a great job. I suppose the lighting on the pepper could have been brighter. Had you used a thread to tie the pepper, then more light would be difficult. I think the red line on the border could have been a lot thinner.', '2010-02-03 11:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5850882, 850997, 74911, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of a rainbow. But I am not able to see the theme here, despite your title. I am afraid if you may be voted less, as voters would consider this a shoe-horn entry.</td>', 'This is a great shot of a rainbow. But I am not able to see the theme here, despite your title. I am afraid if you may be voted less, as voters would consider this a shoe-horn entry.', '2010-02-03 11:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
