(5851075, 851669, 28427, '<td valign="top">If I see correctly, this has been flipped 90° counter clockwise.  At least, that''s what I think. The smoke and burning coal (I think its coal?) are visible, but I find the rest of the scenery slightly too dark.</td>', 'If I see correctly, this has been flipped 90° counter clockwise.  At least, that''s what I think. The smoke and burning coal (I think its coal?) are visible, but I find the rest of the scenery slightly too dark.', '2010-02-03 12:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5851101, 851563, 28427, '<td valign="top">Good set-up, nice and sharp photograph.  Almost perfect to me.  Almost, because there''s one small thing I miss and that is the vapor of the hot boiling water and coffee.  Now I get the feeling you poured cold water in the cup.  Yet, this is a personal feeling which doesn''t change all the other positive things. *7*</td>', 'Good set-up, nice and sharp photograph.  Almost perfect to me.  Almost, because there''s one small thing I miss and that is the vapor of the hot boiling water and coffee.  Now I get the feeling you poured cold water in the cup.  Yet, this is a personal feeling which doesn''t change all the other positive things. *7*', '2010-02-03 13:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
