(5851781, 851632, 112177, '<td valign="top">the color loses a lot of the punch this could have.  When we solder the color of the flame as it surrounds the metal is nice to watch. This color choice makes the flame too bright to appreciate.  Love the instinct to go to the torch though.</td>', 'the color loses a lot of the punch this could have.  When we solder the color of the flame as it surrounds the metal is nice to watch. This color choice makes the flame too bright to appreciate.  Love the instinct to go to the torch though.', '2010-02-03 21:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5851786, 850640, 112177, '<td valign="top">I love the way the flame changes color as it surrounds the glass but the yellow is really out of focus. Fire is a difficult model to photograph as it is ever changing.  I wonder if you were able to reduce the light on the yellow flame side if it would be more detailed but as I said the challenge seems to be the ever changing flame makes lighting difficult. The blue is wonderful. Nice concept.</td>', 'I love the way the flame changes color as it surrounds the glass but the yellow is really out of focus. Fire is a difficult model to photograph as it is ever changing.  I wonder if you were able to reduce the light on the yellow flame side if it would be more detailed but as I said the challenge seems to be the ever changing flame makes lighting difficult. The blue is wonderful. Nice concept.', '2010-02-03 21:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5851787, 851736, 112177, '<td valign="top">I know the motion puts it out of focus but it shows movement, the white hot steel and the sparks are great</td>', 'I know the motion puts it out of focus but it shows movement, the white hot steel and the sparks are great', '2010-02-03 21:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
