(5853106, 850961, 17507, '<td valign="top">To me this photo looks rushed and careless, and it conveys not so much ''hotness'' as ''colorized to red and orange in Photoshop.'' I can''t in good conscience score this higher than a 3.</td>', 'To me this photo looks rushed and careless, and it conveys not so much ''hotness'' as ''colorized to red and orange in Photoshop.'' I can''t in good conscience score this higher than a 3.', '2010-02-04 17:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
