(5855581, 851087, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can see some minor compression artifacts around the front of her face and in the details of the surfboard. Your file size of only 56k is also an indicator of a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. <br/> <br/>There is also that tilted horizon which would have been easy to fix.</td>', 'I can see some minor compression artifacts around the front of her face and in the details of the surfboard. Your file size of only 56k is also an indicator of a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.  There is also that tilted horizon which would have been easy to fix.', '2010-02-06 16:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
