(5859404, 851563, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but a bit of steam would really make it fit the theme more strongly.  It''s also important to observe how how photography magnifies scratches and little specks that are practically invisible to the naked eye.  Advanced editing would have permitted you to clone those out.  Very nice exposure, and nice use of black and white in color.</td>', 'I like this image, but a bit of steam would really make it fit the theme more strongly.  It''s also important to observe how how photography magnifies scratches and little specks that are practically invisible to the naked eye.  Advanced editing would have permitted you to clone those out.  Very nice exposure, and nice use of black and white in color.', '2010-02-08 16:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
