(5861305, 851459, 17507, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DCNUTTER:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mycelium:</b></div><hr/><i> Image is very strong--well lit, nicely composed, sharp, edgy, and of course sexy. I don''t really get the title, though--where does the ''Hell'' part come from? Nonetheless a great shot, and I hope to see it in at least the top 10. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You seriously never heard the phrase "Hotter than Hell?" Damn, I must be old. LOL. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh, I know the phrase perfectly well, although I don''t see the tie-in to the photo--unless "Hotter than Hell" comes from "The Seven Year Itch." Haven''t seen the movie, so perhaps we can just chalk this up to my ignorance.</td>', 'Originally posted by DCNUTTER: Originally posted by mycelium: Image is very strong--well lit, nicely composed, sharp, edgy, and of course sexy. I don''t really get the title, though--where does the ''Hell'' part come from? Nonetheless a great shot, and I hope to see it in at least the top 10.   You seriously never heard the phrase "Hotter than Hell?" Damn, I must be old. LOL.   Oh, I know the phrase perfectly well, although I don''t see the tie-in to the photo--unless "Hotter than Hell" comes from "The Seven Year Itch." Haven''t seen the movie, so perhaps we can just chalk this up to my ignorance.', '2010-02-10 02:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
