(5861412, 851670, 113419, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I think the sub-4 average was a bit harder than this deserved, but that''s how mass appeal works out sometimes. The photo got a 6 from me and he got a 10 from my daughter. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>lol  Thanks Spiff!  And tell your daughter the tatts are very real.<br/> <br/>So, as you can see I''m not "into myself" as it''s not a self portrait and the title isn''t meant to be "egotistical"....what it is though is a spoff off that song....Don''t You Wish Your Girlfriend Was HOT LIKE ME!  lol<br/> <br/>As I said, I just thought this would be fun as I knew there would be female versions of HOT so I figured I''d give the women of DPC something to look at too.  And Texxsmith - women know when other women are hot - and men do know when other men are hot.  <br/> <br/>I really love all those side lite black/white photos so I thought I''d give it a try and though I know I still have alot to learn about it I figure this is not too bad for a first try at it.  And next time I try it I''ll use something besides the comforter as  backdrop.  ;-)<br/>ETA - the thumbnail looks GREAT!  LOL<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-10 14:01:22.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: I think the sub-4 average was a bit harder than this deserved, but that''s how mass appeal works out sometimes. The photo got a 6 from me and he got a 10 from my daughter.   lol  Thanks Spiff!  And tell your daughter the tatts are very real. So, as you can see I''m not "into myself" as it''s not a self portrait and the title isn''t meant to be "egotistical"....what it is though is a spoff off that song....Don''t You Wish Your Girlfriend Was HOT LIKE ME!  lol As I said, I just thought this would be fun as I knew there would be female versions of HOT so I figured I''d give the women of DPC something to look at too.  And Texxsmith - women know when other women are hot - and men do know when other men are hot.   I really love all those side lite black/white photos so I thought I''d give it a try and though I know I still have alot to learn about it I figure this is not too bad for a first try at it.  And next time I try it I''ll use something besides the comforter as  backdrop.  ;-)ETA - the thumbnail looks GREAT!  LOL', '2010-02-10 06:26:34.000000', '2010-02-10 14:01:22.000000', 0),
(5861413, 851574, 60868, '<td valign="top">For those of you wondering how I did it:<br/>-the match is fixed at its lower part<br/>-camera manually focused on the match<br/>-a flash behind the match, to the right, in manual, enough to properly expose the match (without the flame)<br/>-black drop behind<br/>-I lit the match with a lighter, while pressing the shutter almost at the same time (of course, I quickly remove the lighter from the field of the camera)<br/> <br/>A lot of tries and different shapes. I like the best this one <br/> <br/>Thank you for your comments</td>', 'For those of you wondering how I did it:-the match is fixed at its lower part-camera manually focused on the match-a flash behind the match, to the right, in manual, enough to properly expose the match (without the flame)-black drop behind-I lit the match with a lighter, while pressing the shutter almost at the same time (of course, I quickly remove the lighter from the field of the camera) A lot of tries and different shapes. I like the best this one  Thank you for your comments', '2010-02-10 06:26:46.000000', NULL, 0),
