(5861651, 851459, 30861, '<td valign="top">Good to see another entry from you, Jorge. What''s remarkable here is that you managed two interesting things:<br/> <br/>1: You got a "naughty" picture through intact; well-veiled naughtiness, but still...<br/> <br/>2: You managed to convince the voters you were portraying "hot" without a single warm tone in the image.<br/> <br/>Well done, friend!</td>', 'Good to see another entry from you, Jorge. What''s remarkable here is that you managed two interesting things: 1: You got a "naughty" picture through intact; well-veiled naughtiness, but still... 2: You managed to convince the voters you were portraying "hot" without a single warm tone in the image. Well done, friend!', '2010-02-10 10:04:24.000000', NULL, 0),
