(5862436, 851459, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good to see the prudes were unsuccessful at shooting this one down. Fantastic composition and a brilliant shot. Well done</td>', 'Good to see the prudes were unsuccessful at shooting this one down. Fantastic composition and a brilliant shot. Well done', '2010-02-10 18:32:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862463, 851693, 82749, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 10 finish!!!</td>', 'Congrats on the top 10 finish!!!', '2010-02-10 19:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862663, 851459, 75328, '<td valign="top">haha. yess!! <br/>definitely refreshing on the dpc homepage.</td>', 'haha. yess!! definitely refreshing on the dpc homepage.', '2010-02-10 21:35:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862666, 851459, 109341, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe that 10 people voted this a 1 out of 10!   That is just ridiculous.  No matter how you feel about the topic and subject matter, from a pure technical perspective this image deserved higher and I''m glad it took a ribbon.  Considering how many technically awful shots I see on here, this thing is a sham.</td>', 'I cannot believe that 10 people voted this a 1 out of 10!   That is just ridiculous.  No matter how you feel about the topic and subject matter, from a pure technical perspective this image deserved higher and I''m glad it took a ribbon.  Considering how many technically awful shots I see on here, this thing is a sham.', '2010-02-10 21:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862691, 851459, 49954, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Hussar1812:</b></div><hr/><i> I cannot believe that 10 people voted this a 1 out of 10!   That is just ridiculous.  No matter how you feel about the topic and subject matter, from a pure technical perspective this image deserved higher and I''m glad it took a ribbon.  Considering how many technically awful shots I see on here, this thing is a sham. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Did not vote on this one, but hey... content is just as much a part of the photo as the technical merits.</td>', 'Originally posted by Hussar1812: I cannot believe that 10 people voted this a 1 out of 10!   That is just ridiculous.  No matter how you feel about the topic and subject matter, from a pure technical perspective this image deserved higher and I''m glad it took a ribbon.  Considering how many technically awful shots I see on here, this thing is a sham.   Did not vote on this one, but hey... content is just as much a part of the photo as the technical merits.', '2010-02-10 22:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862723, 851459, 109341, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf:</b></div><hr/><i>Did not vote on this one, but hey... content is just as much a part of the photo as the technical merits. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>And I completely agree with that, but I would have assumed that 1-3 rating would be reserved for images which lack both content/topic and technical merit.  Perhaps it''s just me but if I find the image "average" I rate it about 5, maybe my interpretation of the 1-10 scale differs from the rest of the DPC community.  Just for the sake of transparency I voted a 6 for this particular image.</td>', 'Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf:Did not vote on this one, but hey... content is just as much a part of the photo as the technical merits.   And I completely agree with that, but I would have assumed that 1-3 rating would be reserved for images which lack both content/topic and technical merit.  Perhaps it''s just me but if I find the image "average" I rate it about 5, maybe my interpretation of the 1-10 scale differs from the rest of the DPC community.  Just for the sake of transparency I voted a 6 for this particular image.', '2010-02-10 22:34:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862732, 850939, 109341, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge!  Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge!  Congrats on the ribbon.', '2010-02-10 22:35:45.000000', NULL, 0),
