(5863051, 851459, 61961, '<td valign="top">Oh, a DQ is a terrible disappointment -- this image so deserves its blue.  I love seeing it on the front page.</td>', 'Oh, a DQ is a terrible disappointment -- this image so deserves its blue.  I love seeing it on the front page.', '2010-02-11 09:50:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5863053, 851459, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhhhhh. .. Jorge! I am so sorry!  Hey.  Don''t worry about disappointing US at ALL!  It has happened to so many of us anyway (and it most certainly <b><i>isn''t</i></b> an unforgivable mistake).  Our only disappointment is disappointment for YOU for losing your well-deserved blue ribbon!<br/> <br/>It sure is an awesome photo!  And you are such a genius!<br/> <br/>P.S. I just noticed that this won with flying colors even with <b>10</b> 1''s!!!  That is just beyond imagination that 10 people so pathetically did that!  But even more of a tribute to this photography to survive that!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-11 09:56:22.</i></td>', 'Ohhhhhhhhh. .. Jorge! I am so sorry!  Hey.  Don''t worry about disappointing US at ALL!  It has happened to so many of us anyway (and it most certainly isn''t an unforgivable mistake).  Our only disappointment is disappointment for YOU for losing your well-deserved blue ribbon! It sure is an awesome photo!  And you are such a genius! P.S. I just noticed that this won with flying colors even with 10 1''s!!!  That is just beyond imagination that 10 people so pathetically did that!  But even more of a tribute to this photography to survive that!', '2010-02-11 09:51:24.000000', '2010-02-11 09:56:22.000000', 0),
(5863058, 850948, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooh!  Nice JOB!  Looks like a magazine ad!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ooooh!  Nice JOB!  Looks like a magazine ad! ', '2010-02-11 09:57:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5863062, 850939, 24454, '<td valign="top">Way to go!  Both you &amp; davenit.  They each have a different look, but each amazing!  Congratulations!</td>', 'Way to go!  Both you & davenit.  They each have a different look, but each amazing!  Congratulations!', '2010-02-11 10:00:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5863065, 851402, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  And anyway, then you would have ruined a perfectly good steak.  Congratulations on what I think is perfection just like it is :)</td>', 'This is awesome!  And anyway, then you would have ruined a perfectly good steak.  Congratulations on what I think is perfection just like it is :)', '2010-02-11 10:02:06.000000', NULL, 0),
