(5863072, 851557, 24454, '<td valign="top">Now, this really surprises me to see this one not being in the very top few. I''m not accustomed to seeing Irene photography not get its just reward :(  This is really really good!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Now, this really surprises me to see this one not being in the very top few. I''m not accustomed to seeing Irene photography not get its just reward :(  This is really really good! ', '2010-02-11 10:05:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5863073, 851605, 24454, '<td valign="top">Whoa! That is amazing!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Whoa! That is amazing! ', '2010-02-11 10:06:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5863075, 851709, 24454, '<td valign="top">I just love welding photos and this is really good!  I entered one in the last Heat challenge and it got decidedly snubbed.  I would have had this one on the front page -- but the voters obviously disagree with us about what makes a cool heat photo, don''t they!</td>', 'I just love welding photos and this is really good!  I entered one in the last Heat challenge and it got decidedly snubbed.  I would have had this one on the front page -- but the voters obviously disagree with us about what makes a cool heat photo, don''t they!', '2010-02-11 10:07:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5863143, 851459, 42256, '<td valign="top">I really wish DPC can make an exception, clearly the shot was taken during the time frame and with the challenge in mind and having a date as further in time is a clear indication that no foul play was attempted!<br/> <br/>Would hate to see you stripped of a well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'I really wish DPC can make an exception, clearly the shot was taken during the time frame and with the challenge in mind and having a date as further in time is a clear indication that no foul play was attempted! Would hate to see you stripped of a well deserved ribbon!', '2010-02-11 11:09:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5863303, 851459, 105457, '<td valign="top">Whatever the placing and decision may be, it''s a fantastic shot nonetheless.<br/>Still proves that you have what it takes (not that there was any doubt:)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Whatever the placing and decision may be, it''s a fantastic shot nonetheless.Still proves that you have what it takes (not that there was any doubt:) ', '2010-02-11 13:32:56.000000', NULL, 0),
