(5865711, 851402, 16106, '<td valign="top">Grats on the back door ribbon Mark, very nice work, and thanks for the "how to" lighting link, I''d agree with the idea of a stronger gel, and perhaps had you rotated the background so it was a bit simpler, it would have put more focus on the heroic barbeque master. Great idea, well executed, shame about the model ;)<br/></td>', 'Grats on the back door ribbon Mark, very nice work, and thanks for the "how to" lighting link, I''d agree with the idea of a stronger gel, and perhaps had you rotated the background so it was a bit simpler, it would have put more focus on the heroic barbeque master. Great idea, well executed, shame about the model ;)', '2010-02-13 15:20:51.000000', NULL, 0),
